# Q503: Kusto at cond 3 for a leader holding the Black Anvil Coin and no Brooch of the Magpie (30512-04): his only link (30512-03) trades a brooch the leader lacks,
# so the coin stays and nothing changes.
# Go-only: expectations recorded from the Go run and checked by hand against the reference quest script.
character Leader 40
clan 4
quest Q503_PursuitOfClanAmbition <cond>=3 <state>=STARTED
hold 3871 1
script quest.Q503_PursuitOfClanAmbition
item 3839 3840 3841 3842 3843 3844 3846 3847 3867 3869 3870 3871
page villagemaster/30512.htm
page script/quest/Q503_PursuitOfClanAmbition/
npc kusto 30512 VillageMaster 10 0 0

action kusto
action kusto
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=kusto item=0 page=villagemaster/30512.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{kusto}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=kusto item=0 page=script/quest/Q503_PursuitOfClanAmbition/30512-04.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest Q503_PursuitOfClanAmbition 30512-03.htm
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=kusto item=0 page=script/quest/Q503_PursuitOfClanAmbition/30512-03.htm
  S ActionFailed
  rows Q503_PursuitOfClanAmbition <cond>=3 <state>=STARTED
  items 3871=1 3843=0
